# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checkout OS —
# a CRLF shebang line (e.g. "#!/usr/bin/env bash\r") breaks execution on
# Linux ("bad interpreter" error). Relevant here because this repo is
# checked out both on the Windows Jenkins host and on the RHEL host running
# the k8s learning/staging replica (see scripts/security-check-rhel.sh).
*.sh text eol=lf
